   "notes": [],
   "source_text": "The best all-round pick for Shipment. The suppressor keeps you off the minimap in a map where everyone is checking it, and the laser and Fireline grip keep the M4 snappy when you round a container. Quick Fix heals you on every kill, so you can chain fights without backing off. Swap Scavenger for Battle Hardened if you're eating a lot of flashes and stuns. Build for recoil and range; it already handles well. Use it as your first class while you level everything else. On SMG-heavy maps, try the Hurricane Apex instead of switching guns."
  },
